// 版の情報（エクスプローラーのプロパティの「詳細」に出る）とアイコン。CMake の iroha_version_resource が作る
#pragma code_page(65001)
#include <winver.h>

@IROHA_RC_ICON@

VS_VERSION_INFO VERSIONINFO
 FILEVERSION @IROHA_VERSION_MAJOR@,@IROHA_VERSION_MINOR@,@IROHA_VERSION_PATCH@,0
 PRODUCTVERSION @IROHA_VERSION_MAJOR@,@IROHA_VERSION_MINOR@,@IROHA_VERSION_PATCH@,0
 FILEFLAGSMASK 0x3fL
 FILEFLAGS 0x0L
 FILEOS VOS_NT_WINDOWS32
 FILETYPE @IROHA_RC_FILETYPE@
 FILESUBTYPE 0x0L
BEGIN
    BLOCK "StringFileInfo"
    BEGIN
        BLOCK "041104b0"
        BEGIN
            VALUE "CompanyName", "Tetsuaki Baba"
            VALUE "FileDescription", "@IROHA_RC_DESCRIPTION@"
            VALUE "FileVersion", "@IROHA_VERSION_TEXT@"
            VALUE "InternalName", "@IROHA_RC_FILENAME@"
            VALUE "LegalCopyright", "Copyright (c) 2026 Tetsuaki Baba. MIT License."
            VALUE "OriginalFilename", "@IROHA_RC_FILENAME@"
            VALUE "ProductName", "iroha"
            VALUE "ProductVersion", "@IROHA_VERSION_TEXT@"
        END
    END
    BLOCK "VarFileInfo"
    BEGIN
        VALUE "Translation", 0x411, 1200
    END
END
